direction: right
User: User and device {shape: person}
Proxy: Identity-aware proxy {shape: hexagon}
Identity: Identity provider {shape: rectangle}
Posture: Device posture service {shape: rectangle}
Policy: Policy decision point {shape: diamond}
App: Protected application {shape: rectangle}
Audit: Audit log {shape: stored_data}
User -> Proxy: request
Proxy -> Identity: authenticate
Proxy -> Posture: device signals
Identity -> Policy: identity claims
Posture -> Policy: trust signals
Proxy -> Policy: access context
Policy -> Proxy: allow or deny
Proxy -> App: authorized request
Proxy -> Audit: decision
App -> Audit: activity
